{
  "_comment": "Codex worker settings (decision 596), validated by codex_backend.load_codex_config; README.md 'Codex workers'. Role models follow .agents/policy/PM_POLICY.md section 2 (a harder task overrides with `cli_worker.py start --model gpt-6.1-sol --effort high`). Values in <angle brackets> are placeholders that load_codex_config refuses: set them in a local copy and pass `cli_worker.py start --codex-config <copy>` (nothing machine-specific is committed).",
